flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Navigate to /login]
    B --> C[Enter email and password]
    C --> D{Credentials valid?}
    D -->|No| E[Show validation error]
    E --> C
    D -->|Yes| F{2FA enabled?}
    F -->|No| G[Create authenticated session]
    F -->|Yes| H[Redirect to /two-factor-challenge]
    H --> I[Enter TOTP code]
    I --> J{Code valid?}
    J -->|No| K[Show error]
    K --> I
    J -->|Yes| G
    G --> L[Redirect to /dashboard]
    L --> M([End])
